# JG Mart Conventions

- Source of truth: this repo (`G:\JGC Mart`). GitHub: `FahadIbrahim93/jgmart-hermes`.
- Do NOT create sibling agent folders (Grok/Kimi/Hermes). All work lives here.
- Do NOT create duplicate MASTER_INDEX files. Use `MASTER_INDEX.md` at repo root.
- Do NOT use localStorage for new features — use Supabase (`src/web/supabase/`).
- Do NOT adopt Next.js or Convex unless the user explicitly requests a stack change.
- Before adding files, check `MASTER_INDEX.md` for existing assets.
- New docs → `docs/`; brand assets → `assets/brand/`; trackers → `data/trackers/`.
- `_archive/agents/` is read-only reference. Do not edit archived agent outputs.
- Run `python tests/validate_toolkit.py` after structural changes.
